---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import Avatar from './Avatar.astro';
---
<div class="bw-mobile-story" data-booking-demo>
  <div class="bw-mobile-story-stage">
    <div class="bw-mobile-story-head" aria-hidden="true"><span>จองยังไง</span><strong>ให้ลูกค้าจองเองผ่าน LINE OA ของร้านคุณ</strong></div>
    <div class="bw-mobile-story-visuals">
    <div class="bw-mobile-story-visual is-active" data-story-visual="0">
      <div class="bw-mobile-story-shop"><img class="bw-demo-shop-logo" src="/assets/bookingwhale-logo-blue-160.webp" width="32" height="32" alt="" /><strong>Whale Guide</strong><span>เปิดรับจอง</span></div>
      <div class="bw-mobile-story-date"><Icon name="calendar" /><div><small>เลือกวันที่คุณสะดวก</small><strong>ต.ค. 2569</strong></div></div>
      <div class="bw-mobile-story-days" role="group" aria-label="เลือกวันที่คุณสะดวก"><button type="button" data-demo-day="21" aria-pressed="false"><small>พ.</small><b>21</b></button><button type="button" data-demo-day="22" aria-pressed="false"><small>พฤ.</small><b>22</b></button><button type="button" data-demo-day="23" aria-pressed="false"><small>ศ.</small><b>23</b></button><button type="button" data-demo-day="24" aria-pressed="true"><small>ส.</small><b>24</b></button><button type="button" data-demo-day="25" aria-pressed="false"><small>อา.</small><b>25</b></button></div>
      <div class="bw-mobile-story-foot"><span>จองโต๊ะ</span><span>2 คน</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="bw-mobile-story-visual" data-story-visual="1">
      <div class="bw-mobile-story-shop"><img class="bw-demo-shop-logo" src="/assets/bookingwhale-logo-blue-160.webp" width="32" height="32" alt="" /><strong>Whale Guide</strong><span>เปิดรับจอง</span></div>
      <div class="bw-mobile-story-date"><Icon name="calendar" /><div><small>เลือกวันที่คุณสะดวก</small><strong>24 ต.ค. 2569</strong></div></div>
      <div class="bw-mobile-story-slots" role="group" aria-label="เลือกเวลาจอง"><button type="button" data-demo-slot="19:00 – 20:00" aria-pressed="true">19:00 – 20:00 <Icon name="check-circle-2" /></button><button type="button" data-demo-slot="20:30 – 21:30" aria-pressed="false">20:30 – 21:30 <Icon name="check-circle-2" /></button></div>
      <div class="bw-mobile-story-foot"><span>จองโต๊ะ</span><span>2 คน</span></div><button type="button" class="bw-demo-action" data-demo-review hidden>ดูรายละเอียด <Icon name="arrow-right" /></button>
    </div>
    <div class="bw-mobile-story-visual" data-story-visual="2">
      <div class="bw-mobile-story-confirmed"><Icon name="check-circle-2" /><strong>ยืนยันแล้ว</strong></div>
      <div class="bw-mobile-story-ticket"><span class="bw-mobile-story-day">24<small>ต.ค.</small></span><div><strong>Whale Guide</strong><span data-demo-time>19:00 – 20:00</span><small>จองโต๊ะ · 2 คน</small></div></div>
      <div class="bw-mobile-story-foot"><span>รายละเอียดการจอง</span><span>24 ต.ค. 2569</span></div><button type="button" class="bw-demo-action" data-demo-confirm hidden>ยืนยันการจอง <Icon name="arrow-right" /></button>
    </div>
    <div class="bw-mobile-story-visual" data-story-visual="3">
      <div class="bw-mobile-story-shop"><Icon name="store" /><strong>การจองของร้าน</strong><span>2 รายการ</span></div>
      <div class="bw-mobile-story-customer bw-mobile-story-arrival"><span class="bw-mobile-story-avatar"><Avatar person="emma" /></span><div><strong>Emma Wilson</strong><small><span data-demo-time>19:00 – 20:00</span> · <span>จองโต๊ะ · 2 คน</span></small></div><span class="bw-mobile-story-status">ยืนยันแล้ว</span></div>
      <div class="bw-mobile-story-customer"><span class="bw-mobile-story-avatar"><Avatar person="daniel" /></span><div><strong>Daniel Carter</strong><small>20:30 – 21:30</small></div><span class="bw-mobile-story-status">ยืนยันแล้ว</span></div>
      <div class="bw-mobile-story-history"><Icon name="calendar-check" /><div><span>รับจองผ่าน LINE OA</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="bw-mobile-story-visual" data-story-visual="4">
      <div class="bw-mobile-story-profile"><span class="bw-mobile-story-avatar bw-mobile-story-avatar-lg"><Avatar person="emma" /></span><div><strong>Emma Wilson</strong><small>สมาชิกตั้งแต่ 6/9/2026</small></div><span class="bw-mobile-story-status">ใช้งาน</span></div>
      <div class="bw-mobile-story-row"><small>รหัสลูกค้า</small><code>BW-001284</code></div>
      <div class="bw-mobile-story-history"><Icon name="clock" /><div><strong>การจองล่าสุด</strong><span><span>24 ต.ค.</span> · <span data-demo-time>19:00 – 20:00</span> · <span>จองโต๊ะ · 2 คน</span></span></div></div>
    </div>
    </div>
  <ol class="bw-mobile-story-steps">
    <li class="bw-mobile-story-step is-active" data-story-step="0"><span class="bw-mobile-story-index" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>ลูกค้าจองเอง<br /><em>ผ่าน LINE OA</em></h3><p>เปิดหน้าจอง เลือกวันได้จาก LINE OA ของร้าน</p></li>
    <li class="bw-mobile-story-step" data-story-step="1"><span class="bw-mobile-story-index" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>เห็นเวลาว่าง<br /><em>เลือกได้ทันที</em></h3><p>ลูกค้าเห็นรอบที่เปิดรับ ไม่ต้องทักถามเวลาว่างทีละข้อความ</p></li>
    <li class="bw-mobile-story-step" data-story-step="2"><span class="bw-mobile-story-index" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>จองเรียบร้อย<br /><em>รายละเอียดครบ</em></h3><p>วัน เวลา และจำนวนคน รวมอยู่ในรายการเดียว</p></li>
    <li class="bw-mobile-story-step" data-story-step="3" data-mobile-story="manage"><span class="bw-mobile-story-index" aria-hidden="true">04</span><h3>การจองเข้ามา<br /><em>ร้านก็เห็นทันที</em></h3><p>รวมชื่อ เวลา และสถานะ ไม่ต้องไล่รวมจากหลายแชท</p></li>
    <li class="bw-mobile-story-step" data-story-step="4"><span class="bw-mobile-story-index" aria-hidden="true">05</span><h3>ดูประวัติการจอง<br /><em>รู้จักลูกค้ามากขึ้น</em></h3><p>เปิดโปรไฟล์ดูข้อมูลและการจองเดิม ไม่ต้องค้นแชทเก่า</p></li>
  </ol>
  </div>
  <div class="bw-mobile-story-track" aria-hidden="true"><span data-story-spacer="0"></span><span data-story-spacer="1"></span><span data-story-spacer="2"></span><span data-story-spacer="3"></span><span data-story-spacer="4"></span></div>
</div>
<script>import { initMobileBookingDemo } from "../scripts/mobile-booking-demo"; initMobileBookingDemo();</script>
<style is:global>
  #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story { display:none; }
  @media(max-width:900px) {
    #bookingwhale #features > .bw-flow { display:none; }
    #bookingwhale #main-content > section#features { padding-block:40px 32px; background:#f5f5f7; box-shadow:0 0 0 100vmax #f5f5f7; clip-path:inset(0 -100vmax); }
    #bookingwhale #main-content > section#features::before, #bookingwhale #main-content > section#features::after { background:#f5f5f7; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story { display:block; position:relative; max-width:520px; margin:0 auto; padding:0; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-stage { position:sticky; top:72px; z-index:2; display:grid; align-content:center; gap:18px; box-sizing:border-box; min-height:calc(100svh - 72px); padding:12px 0 28px; background:transparent; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-head { display:grid; gap:6px; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-head span { color:var(--bw-blue); font-size:13px; font-weight:600; line-height:1.4; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-head strong { color:var(--bw-ink); font-size:24px; font-weight:700; line-height:1.3; letter-spacing:-.02em; text-wrap:balance; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-visuals { display:grid; }
    #bookingwhale #features .bw-mobile-story-visuals > .bw-mobile-story-visual { grid-area:1 / 1; align-self:stretch; min-width:0; opacity:0; visibility:hidden; will-change:opacity, transform; }
    #bookingwhale #features .bw-mobile-story-visuals > .bw-mobile-story-visual.is-active { opacity:1; visibility:visible; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-steps { display:grid; margin:0; padding:0; list-style:none; }
    #bookingwhale #features .bw-mobile-story-step { grid-area:1 / 1; display:grid; align-content:start; gap:4px; margin:0; padding:0; border:0; background:none; opacity:0; visibility:hidden; will-change:opacity, transform; }
    #bookingwhale #features .bw-mobile-story-step.is-active { opacity:1; visibility:visible; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-index { color:var(--bw-blue); font-size:13px; font-weight:600; line-height:1.4; }
    #bookingwhale #features .bw-mobile-story h3 { margin:0; color:var(--bw-ink); font-size:21px; line-height:1.35; letter-spacing:-.02em; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-step p { margin:0; color:var(--bw-muted); font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-track { display:block; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-track > span { display:block; height:34svh; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-track > span:last-child { height:18svh; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-visual { padding:20px; border:0; border-radius:22px; background:#fff; color:var(--bw-ink); font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; }
    #bookingwhale #features .bw-mobile-story-visual:not([data-story-visual="1"]) { display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; }
    #bookingwhale #features .bw-mobile-story h3 em { font-style:normal; color:var(--bw-blue); }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-days { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:6px; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-days > button { font:inherit; display:grid; gap:2px; justify-items:center; min-height:56px; padding:8px 0; border:1px solid var(--bw-line); border-radius:12px; background:#fff; color:var(--bw-ink); cursor:pointer; transition:background-color .25s, border-color .25s, color .25s; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-days > button b { font-size:17px; font-weight:600; line-height:1.2; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-days > [aria-pressed="true"] { border-color:var(--bw-blue); background:var(--bw-blue); color:#fff; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-days > [aria-pressed="true"] small { color:#fff; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-customer + .bw-mobile-story-customer { padding-top:0; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-profile { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; padding-bottom:16px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--bw-line); }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-profile > div { display:grid; gap:2px; min-width:0; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-avatar-lg { width:48px; height:48px; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-row { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; padding-block:16px; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-row code { font:inherit; font-size:13px; font-weight:600; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-visual svg { flex:none; width:20px; height:20px; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-shop { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; padding-bottom:16px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--bw-line); }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-shop > span { margin-left:auto; color:var(--bw-muted); font-size:11px; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-date { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; padding-block:18px; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-date div, #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-ticket > div, #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-customer > div, #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-history > div { display:grid; gap:4px; min-width:0; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story small { color:var(--bw-muted); font-size:12px; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-slots { display:grid; gap:8px; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-slots > button { font:inherit; background:#fff; color:var(--bw-ink); cursor:pointer; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; min-height:44px; padding:8px 12px; border:1px solid var(--bw-line); border-radius:10px; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-slots > [aria-pressed="true"] { border-color:var(--bw-blue); color:var(--bw-blue); background:#f0f4ff; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-slots > [aria-pressed="false"] svg { visibility:hidden; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-demo-action:not([hidden]) { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:10px; min-height:44px; width:100%; margin-top:16px; padding:10px 16px; border:0; border-radius:999px; background:var(--bw-blue); color:#fff; font:inherit; font-weight:600; cursor:pointer; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-demo-action:disabled { background:#edf7f1; color:#26754b; cursor:default; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story button:focus-visible { outline:2px solid var(--bw-blue); outline-offset:4px; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-foot { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; margin-top:16px; padding-top:14px; border-top:1px solid var(--bw-line); font-size:12px; color:var(--bw-muted); }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-confirmed { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; color:#26754b; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-ticket { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:16px; padding-block:24px 8px; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-day { display:grid; flex:none; place-items:center; width:60px; padding:8px; border:1px solid var(--bw-line); border-radius:12px; font-size:28px; font-weight:600; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-customer { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; padding-block:20px; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-avatar { flex:none; width:34px; height:34px; overflow:hidden; border-radius:50%; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-status { margin-left:auto; color:#26754b; font-size:11px; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-history { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; padding-top:16px; border-top:1px solid var(--bw-line); }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-history span { color:var(--bw-muted); font-size:12px; }
  }
  @media(max-width:900px) and (max-height:700px) {
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-stage { top:64px; gap:12px; min-height:calc(100svh - 64px); }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-head strong { font-size:20px; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-visual { padding:16px; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-date { padding-block:12px; }
    #bookingwhale #features .bw-mobile-story h3 { font-size:19px; }
    #bookingwhale .bw-mobile-story-step p { font-size:14px; }
  }
  @media(max-width:900px) and (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { #bookingwhale #features .bw-mobile-story-visuals > .bw-mobile-story-visual, #bookingwhale #features .bw-mobile-story-step { transition:none; transform:none; } }
</style>
